  "narration": "Cloudflare launched a Web Search API for AI agents. It adds live web grounding through AI Gateway. Agents can search instead of confidently inventing a URL. Cloudflare supports Ceramic.ai, Exa, and Linkup at launch. All three offer Zero Data Retention through Cloudflare. Search requests also appear in your AI Gateway logs. Pricing follows each provider's list API price. Cloudflare says there is no extra markup. You can also bring your own provider key. The useful part is the shared interface. Swap search providers without rebuilding the whole agent stack. Fewer hallucinated URLs is a respectable feature.",
